# Pull Through the Weft: "up to two target nonland permanent cards ... to your hand, then up to two target land cards ... to the
# battlefield tapped" (CR 601.2c, 608.2c). Three Faithless Loots (Black Lotus's RRR) put three nonland permanent cards (Memnite,
# Ornithopter, Mox Jet) and three lands (Island, Forest, Mountain) in the graveyard. Three of either kind are more than the
# slot takes, and a land is no nonland target. Two of each come back, the lands tapped, and the third of each stays behind.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Faithless Looting
Faithless Looting
Memnite
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Island
Forest
Mountain
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Pull Through the Weft
Forest
Island x4

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Memnite; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Mox Jet; Island)
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Forest; Mountain)
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 10
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pull Through the Weft.Cast
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Memnite; Bot1.Graveyard.Ornithopter; Bot1.Graveyard.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Memnite; Bot1.Graveyard.Mox Jet)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Island; Bot1.Graveyard.Forest; Bot1.Graveyard.Mountain)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Island; Bot1.Graveyard.Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Pull Through the Weft; Faithless Looting; Mountain; Faithless Looting; Faithless Looting; Ornithopter; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Tapped = true
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
